{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42720","headline":"志峡船具诗 梢 · 王周","name":"志峡船具诗 梢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"制之居首尾，俾之辨斜正。\n首动尾聿随，斜取正爲定。\n有如提吏笔，有如执时柄。\n有如秉师律，有如宣命令。\n守彼方与直，得其刚且劲。\n既能济险难，何畏涉辽敻。\n招招俾作主，泛泛实司命。\n风乌愧斟酌，画鷁空辉映。\n古人存丰规，猗欤聊引证。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王周","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}